From: dianqk <dianqk@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 12:30:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add optional fixed-orientation GLES RGB to NV12 VPP

Local extension of https://github.com/radxa-pkg/libva-v4l2/tree/0e4ce1e05da1d0a92b342efc2090b9e4987035e1
Keep the upstream FFmpeg and recorder unchanged. Support static orientation; no in-recording rotation, mirroring or HDR.

